  "source_code": "t=int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(t):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=sorted(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    p=[0]\r\n    for x in a:\r\n        p.append(p[-1]+x)\r\n    def f(x,y):\r\n        return 2*p[x]+p[x+2*y]+3*p[3*n-2*x-y]\r\n    y=n\r\n    ans=0\r\n    for x in range(n+1):\r\n        y=min(y,n-x)\r\n        while y>0 and f(x,y-1)>=f(x,y):\r\n            y-=1\r\n        ans=max(ans,f(x,y))\r\n    print(ans)",
